PDP-8A CPU Test
.components
.problem
A glitch on the power line cause a false failure error message
and the processor to halt. This pr08elm occurs on APT
and prevents long acceptance runs.
.solution
A delay has been added to the power failure, after the
volatile information has been saved. To allow
recovery from a glitch. This solution has been implemented
for APT only. It does not affect the field.
